  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-08-19, verbatim: 'yes, update the playbook. I approve and I approve using auto-pr without --gov'.\n\nScope: the docstring-staleness-audit playbook under .agent/agent_playbooks_protocols_sops_skills/. Approval covers editing it AND self-merging via auto-pr without the governance flag. Recorded here rather than left in conversation.\n\nContent going in: (1) calibration refreshed -- the documented 2026-05-15 figures (28 flagged / 21 real / 75%) are superseded by this run (45 flagged / 41 real / 91%) at the SAME thresholds; (2) two further measurement artifacts beyond the two documented -- the calendar-decay one #410 fixed, and the newly-observed 'a file re-flags when you edit a FUNCTION docstring inside it, because the scan's body region includes them' (this is what put linkers/ipc.py in the post-audit six); (3) the registry blind spot this item exists to close, so the next runner knows the scan cannot see retired-vocabulary drift; (4) the tracker-ref false-positive shapes, including the 'deferred' collision recorded above."  # af1e
